ur\", \"2.25 miles round-trip\" plus a \"0.75 mile walk from the Wetherill Mesa parking lot\", \"climbing two 15 ft ladders\"; \"Allow 115 minutes to 135 minutes for the entire Long House experience\". Season \"May 22 - October 21\" 2026."},{"name":"Square Tower House Tour","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/cliff_dwelling_tours.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["adventure","hiking","culture"],"booking_route":"Recreation.gov only","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"operator","tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":4,"blurb":"Backcountry: a \"120-minute tour\", \"1-mile in and out\", with \"two 16 ft ladders\" and a \"34 ft long narrow cliff ledge\"; strenuous; \"Bring a minimum of 1/2 gallon (2 liters) of water per person\"."},{"name":"Mug House Tour","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/cliff_dwelling_tours.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["hiking","adventure","culture"],"booking_route":"Recreation.gov only","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"operator","tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":5,"blurb":"Backcountry: a \"120-minute tour\", \"2.25 mile round-trip\"; visitors \"descend/ascend a 6 ft ladder unassisted\"; strenuous."},{"name":"Step House","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/cliff_dwelling_tours.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["culture","hiking","family"],"booking_route":"none needed - covered by the park entrance pass","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":6,"blurb":"Wetherill Mesa: no reservation required, a \"self-guided site when a ranger is present\"; \"1 mile round-trip\" with a \"165 ft\" elevation change."},{"name":"Mesa Top Loop Road","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/visiting-in-winter.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["family","senior","culture","motoring"],"booking_route":"none needed - covered by the park entrance pass","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":7,"blurb":"\"This 6-mile drive features eleven stops with paved trails and views of cliff dwellings like Cliff Palace\"; open daily 8 a.m. to sunset in winter, and year-round for self-guided exploration."},{"name":"Spruce Tree House overlook","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/accessibility.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["senior","culture","family"],"booking_route":"none needed","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":8,"blurb":"\"Spruce Tree House is the best preserved and third-largest cliff dwelling\", seen from a covered porch and accessible overlook near the museum; a daily ranger talk runs here."},{"name":"Mesa Verde Museum","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/hours.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["culture","family","senior"],"booking_route":"none needed","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":9,"blurb":"2026 hours: \"May 4 - October 21: 8:30 am to 4:30 pm, DAILY\", \"October 22 - December 31: 10:00 am to 3:00 pm, DAILY\"; closed for renovations until late April. Wheelchairs to borrow."},{"name":"Petroglyph Point Trail","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/hiking.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["hiking","culture","adventure"],"booking_route":"none needed - free park trail","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":10,"blurb":"2.4 miles roundtrip, 227 ft: \"Very Challenging—unmaintained with a narrow passage, stone stairs, steep edges, loose rock, scrambling required.\" Counterclockwise recommended."},{"name":"Soda Canyon Overlook Trail","source":"https://www.nps.gov/meve/planyourvisit/hiking.htm","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["hiking","family","senior"],"booking_route":"none needed - free park trail","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"