oute":"own website booking (visitmesaverde.com) or 970-529-4465 per NPS","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"hotel","tier_absent_reason":"not-established","wells":["stay"],"draw_rank":16,"blurb":"\"the only lodging located within Mesa Verde National Park\", 15 miles beyond the entrance: 150 Kiva and Kiva Deluxe View rooms; \"no in-room televisions or cell service—just quiet moments, star-filled skies\"; listed season \"April 17 - October 18\"; pet-friendly; operated by Aramark."},{"name":"Morefield Campground","source":"https://www.visitmesaverde.com/stay/morefield-campground","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["family","motoring","hiking","group"],"booking_route":"reservations.ahlsmsworld.com/MesaVerde (Aramark), deposit of first night","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"hotel","tier_absent_reason":"not-established","wells":["stay","shop"],"draw_rank":17,"blurb":"Four miles from the entrance: \"nearly 267\" campsites including \"15 full hook-up RV sites\" and \"17 group sites\"; \"Showers & Laundry Adjacent to Campground Store\", Knife Edge Café breakfast, \"well-stocked grocery and camp store\"; listed season \"April 24 - October 18\"."},{"name":"700 Years Tour","source":"https://www.visitmesaverde.com/activities/tours/700-years-tour","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["culture","senior","family"],"booking_route":"FareHarbor (visitmesaverde-aramark) or in person at Far View Lodge, Far View Terrace or Morefield","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"operator","tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":18,"blurb":"Aramark''s 4-hour coach tour with an \"NAI-certified guide\", short hikes to mesa-top sites and guaranteed Cliff Palace access; adults $129, children (5-11) $99; departs 8:00 am or 1:00 pm from Far View Lodge, May 4 - October 18."},{"name":"Metate Room Restaurant","source":"https://www.visitmesaverde.com/dining/metate-room-restaurant","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["culinary","romance","culture"],"booking_route":